      "text": "We were not able to discover a definitive trend over time, but found a volatile gaming market. That changed trends rapidly without much warning and favor to publishers. Nintendo got lucky and had it's success streak for a while until more recent times.\nThe data indicates that the shooter genre took off after the 2009 and has seen continuous popularity and success",
